      "content": "capacity and service life of battery. Standard working temperature of battery is 20 ℃ ~ 25 ℃ shorten the service life of battery if it is used in condition that ambient temperature is higher than it, and it will reduce the battery capacity if it is used in condition that ambient temperature is lower than",
